{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 3360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1519, "text": "Hee, hee, hee, hoo."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 5780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4000, "text": "Hee, hee, hee, hoo."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 8119, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 6420, "text": "Hee, hee, hee, hoo."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 10280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 8700, "text": "Hee, hee, hee, hoo."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 11860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10860, "text": "Hee, hee."}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 14960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 11960, "text": "Wait right here. I'll get the\nparamedics. Wait, boy, wait."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 16960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 15360, "text": "Wally's just learning how to breathe."}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 19540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 17440, "text": "Well, the way she's doing it seems a\nlittle weird."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 23120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21320, "text": "But then, I'm self -taught."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 29940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 25980, "text": "It's one of the techniques they teach in\nthe natural childbirth classes Mac and"}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 30940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 29940, "text": "I go to."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 33910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 31530, "text": "Hey, macadamia, you're not sure you\nbetter grab this lady."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 36590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34490, "text": "Looks like he's trying to shoplift the\nbeach ball."}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 38570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 37570, "text": "Hello, Harry."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 41510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 38730, "text": "Thanks again for agreeing to swear me in\nas a U .S. citizen."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 42950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 41870, "text": "Oh, you're very, very welcome."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 48110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 43230, "text": "It means a lot to me to be sworn in as a\ncitizen before Junior here beats me to"}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 49110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 48110, "text": "it."}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 52450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 50650, "text": "Something wrong, Mac?"}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 56380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53200, "text": "No, my stomach feels a little\nuncomfortable, that's all."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 58640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 56760, "text": "Could be sympathetic labor pains."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 63340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59340, "text": "I read somewhere where a husband can\nsometimes experience the same symptoms"}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 64238, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 63340, "text": "the mom."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 68080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 64239, "text": "It's true. I went through it when my pet\npython Bertha laid her eggs."}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 74000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 71280, "text": "Well, there must be hell on you when she\nsheds her skin."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 78000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 76260, "text": "Now, this is right here."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 82810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79670, "text": "Ready to start, sir? Yeah. Let's see if\nwe can whip through the rest of the"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 86210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82810, "text": "docket so we can get on with our little\nswearing -in ceremony. Very good, sir."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 87890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 86290, "text": "I'm sure the others won't mind waiting."}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 89190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88190, "text": "Nah."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 92050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 90170, "text": "Uh, Mac, what others?"}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 96050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 92270, "text": "Well, when the Immigration and\nNaturalization Service agreed to our"}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 99530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 96050, "text": "you give the oath to Kwan Lee, I told\nthem you wouldn't mind swearing in a few"}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 101890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99530, "text": "more. Well, hey, the more the merrier."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 113179, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 112200, "text": "these people."}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 115000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113180, "text": "We are the world."}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 172620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 171420, "text": "Judge! Thank you, Bull."}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 174080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 173080, "text": "You got two left."}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 178900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 176380, "text": "Can I have the hired help up to the\nbench here, please?"}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 180520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 179520, "text": "Look at him."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 183140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 180740, "text": "Soon they'll all be part of the great\nmelting pot."}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 185460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 183520, "text": "Be faster just to pop him in the\nmicrowave."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 194700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 190580, "text": "All right, folks. Now, obviously, I'm\ngoing to need the help of anyone and"}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 197740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 194700, "text": "everyone who can show these people a\nlittle patience and compassion."}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 199380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198380, "text": "Great. See you about 10."}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 203040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 200060, "text": "Dan, I need you to. Why?"}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 206660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 203380, "text": "Because we've got to make sure that\neverybody belongs here and that their"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 210000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 206660, "text": "are all in order. I made copies of the\nmaster list for everybody."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 215600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 210240, "text": "Good job, man. Okay, now, you go over\ntheir documents, compare them to the"}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 219420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 215600, "text": "here, and make sure that everything is\nthe way it should be, and let's show"}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 221200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 219420, "text": "a real New York City welcome, huh?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 223840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 221840, "text": "Okay. Give me your wallet."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 228720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227720, "text": "That's the spirit."}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 234940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232000, "text": "Okay, Mr. Costas, Agostillos, and\nfamily."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 236200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235200, "text": "This is me."}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 238620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236460, "text": "Hi, well, if you'd answer... And I am\nproud."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 244220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239200, "text": "I am proud of my past life, and even\nmore, I am proud of my future as an"}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 245220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 244220, "text": "American citizen."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 248200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245520, "text": "So, I dance to my future. Peppa!"}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 255240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 252000, "text": "Dad, please, please, no more dancing,\nyou promised."}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 256779, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 255780, "text": "Dad?"}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 259990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 256910, "text": "I want you to meet Spiros, the fruit of\nmy loin."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 263910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262910, "text": "Cute fruit."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 268010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 265710, "text": "You ever see such a face, Judge, huh?"}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 275650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 268790, "text": "15 years old and already sawing the\nsigns of manhood."}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 277250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 275890, "text": "Dad, it's just a pimple."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 279170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 278150, "text": "It is growth."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 280470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 279470, "text": "I love growth."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 282150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 280570, "text": "I dance to your pimple."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 320190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 318489, "text": "So, what do you do for a living, Clint?"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 323620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 320710, "text": "Before I came to the U .S., President."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 324980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323920, "text": "What company?"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 327360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 325260, "text": "I was president of my country."}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 330960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 328300, "text": "You were president of an entire country?"}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 332760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 331340, "text": "Until the revolution."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 338960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 333800, "text": "Officially, my title was president for\nlife, first minister, defender of the"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 342980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 338960, "text": "constitution, prince regent, and\nprotector of the realm."}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 344820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343820, "text": "And now?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 347020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 345020, "text": "Knight manager of a 7 -Eleven."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 354490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 352330, "text": "You went from a palace to selling\nslurpees."}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 359550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356030, "text": "It does require a bit of adjustment."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 366630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 360390, "text": "One minute hearing your name chanted by\nmillions of adoring followers."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 371630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367270, "text": "The next, making change for the Donkey\nKong game."}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 377630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 373810, "text": "Little mistake here, Mr. Vega. I'm sure\nthey want your income in dollars, not"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 379410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 377630, "text": "pesos. It is dollars."}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 381540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 380400, "text": "I am rich, huh?"}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 385480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 383500, "text": "My social security number is not that\nbig."}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 389920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 386880, "text": "Twelve years ago, my sister and I, we\ncome to this country with nothing."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 392820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 390340, "text": "Today, we know Robin Lynch personally."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 396280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 394800, "text": "What did you do to make this kind of\nmoney?"}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 398120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 396620, "text": "Sell a screwdriver to the Pentagon?"}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 403620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 400320, "text": "The American dream is true, amigo."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 408220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 403980, "text": "With good luck and hard work, my sister\nand I, we made ourselves what we are"}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 409220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 408220, "text": "today."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 412400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 411400, "text": "Not a spare part?"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 419220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 414680, "text": "We started with my grandmother's old\nrecipe and one little push cart."}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 422620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 419480, "text": "Today we got an entire line of\nrestaurants."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 424200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423200, "text": "My cart?"}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 427760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425900, "text": "Batter fried bits."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 429320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428140, "text": "Bits of what?"}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 435320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 433680, "text": "Formerly living things."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 441020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 439700, "text": "Explain this to me."}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 446380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 442420, "text": "You parlayed innards and hot grease into\nthis monstrous fortune?"}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 454080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 447920, "text": "Let's just say, if anyone were to ask my\nsister to be his wife, he would become"}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 455760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 454080, "text": "a very wealthy man."}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 466340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 464460, "text": "Maybe if we dipped you in batter."}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 475540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 474540, "text": "Still bothering you?"}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 476720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 475720, "text": "Yeah."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 480440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 476920, "text": "I guess I'm having flashbacks from that\nlittle breakfast you served up this"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 481440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480440, "text": "morning."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 486660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481580, "text": "I know it was a little out of the\nordinary, but I have these cravings."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 487980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 486980, "text": "Giblet pancakes?"}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 492020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 490440, "text": "Thank you for your patronage."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 498320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 494820, "text": "Okay, Miss Agostino, see when your brood\ncan take a seat."}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 501040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 498860, "text": "I love this America, Judd."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 504020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501520, "text": "It is a country where a man can be..."}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 505540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504280, "text": "Anything he wants."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 507880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 506880, "text": "Realize his dream."}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 510720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509020, "text": "Reach for the stars."}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 513640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 511980, "text": "Dad, you clean toilet."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 516659, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 515539, "text": "I got the promotion."}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 520720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517820, "text": "Come, we will dance to my good fortune."}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 524420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 522320, "text": "Dad, would you cut out the hopping\naround?"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 526600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524920, "text": "I will dance as long as I have feet."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 528880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 527300, "text": "I think I can take care of that."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 534710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 533710, "text": "Here's that affidavit, sir."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 538070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 534870, "text": "All right. Then let's hold this one over\npending the report from the probation"}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 539070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 538070, "text": "officer."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 542970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541030, "text": "That's the last one in holding, Your\nHonor. That's it?"}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 546910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543290, "text": "All right, then. Let's get ready to make\nourselves some Americans."}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 549850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 548190, "text": "Go get them all lined up in front of the\nbench."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 551790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550670, "text": "I'll go get the Uzi."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 569250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567790, "text": "Like to go for a ride around the city?"}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 575490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573570, "text": "Bring it back gas or I'll have to charge\nyou."}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 584890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 579470, "text": "Well, now, I guess I really don't have\nto explain to you folks what an honor"}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 588090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 584890, "text": "privilege it is to become a citizen of\nthe United States of America."}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 592350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 588870, "text": "Every one of you has had to go through a\nlot to reach this moment."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 595550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 592930, "text": "You've learned our language, our\nhistory."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 597480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 596240, "text": "Our secret handshake?"}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 603620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 600220, "text": "Well, you have learned our secret\nhandshake, haven't you?"}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 610440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 606280, "text": "No, no, no. There's no secret handshake.\nI was just kidding."}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 617460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 612980, "text": "I stuffed myself into the dashboard of\nadoption to get here, and he is kidding?"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 621580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 618540, "text": "It's his inalienable right to make an\nass of himself."}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 625390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 624330, "text": "God, he's good."}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 631790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 627070, "text": "All right, then. At this time, I'm going\nto ask each of you to raise your right"}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 634910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 631790, "text": "hand and repeat after me."}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 638210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 637210, "text": "Mac,"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 642710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 639850, "text": "are you all right?"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 647270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643070, "text": "Mac, are you all right? No, no, no, no."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 651330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650110, "text": "You got one left."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 657990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 654410, "text": "sir, don't worry about me. It's just a\nmomentary twinge. Are you sure?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 659230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 658230, "text": "Yes, sir, I'm sure."}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 662810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 659750, "text": "Okay, then let's take another shot at\nit. Raise your hands and repeat."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 665930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 663870, "text": "I hereby declare on oath."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 668590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 666210, "text": "I hereby declare on oath."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 674250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 668850, "text": "That I renounce all allegiance and\nfidelity to any foreign prince or"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 675510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 674510, "text": "That was me."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 686670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 685070, "text": "That wasn't me that time, sir."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 688950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686930, "text": "Well, then who was it? It was me."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 691610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 689810, "text": "Quan Li, what is it?"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 694070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 692350, "text": "I'm in the middle of a contraction."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 696050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 694450, "text": "Are you sure it's a contraction?"}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 698090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 696350, "text": "Yes, I had one before."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 699470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 698470, "text": "How long before?"}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 701490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 699850, "text": "A couple minutes ago."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 703830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 702050, "text": "Oh, my God, they're two minutes apart."}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 706190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 705190, "text": "What's going on?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 717500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716360, "text": "theme from The Exorcist."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 721900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 720600, "text": "Oh, go get an ambulance."}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 724100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722280, "text": "You better make that a double."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 760389, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 759630, "text": "and they need it now."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 763710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 760390, "text": "It's like I told you. We're extremely\nbusy tonight, so the most seriously ill"}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 764750, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 763710, "text": "and injured get treated first."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 766470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 764990, "text": "Good God, what happened to him?"}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 772150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769930, "text": "Well, after high school, I entered the\nservice."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 774770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 772730, "text": "No, no, it's not him. It's these two."}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 778130, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774990, "text": "She's having a baby, and nobody seems to\nknow what's wrong with him."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 781770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 778330, "text": "He's having severe abdominal pains and\nnausea. I think it might be"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 784330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 782070, "text": "But you won't mind if we get a second\nopinion."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 787730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 786290, "text": "Oh, no, of course not."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 796760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 794000, "text": "Get your focal point and do your\nbreathing. Come on now."}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 799880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 796980, "text": "I can't. I forget what I... It's this\none."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 804960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 801340, "text": "I think I can."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 810560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 806580, "text": "My God, that woman can have a baby any\nminute now."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 812900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 811720, "text": "Well, that's lunch."}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 815380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 814380, "text": "Now,"}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 818800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815560, "text": "I got a really wacky notion. She's going\nto have a baby. Wouldn't it be peachy"}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 820860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 818800, "text": "if there were a doctor here to deliver\nit?"}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 823850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 821290, "text": "Well, no promises, but I'll see if I can\nscrounge one up."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 828050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 826510, "text": "The chute didn't open, right?"}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 835730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 831530, "text": "Oh, what's the matter, honey? Is it\nstarting to hurt again?"}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 838570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 836950, "text": "Well, here, just hold on to me."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 845310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 840090, "text": "Thank you for leaving the skin."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 852260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 848520, "text": "So the judge says to the guy, he says,\nyou know, you haven't done very well by"}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 855940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852260, "text": "your ex -wife, so I'm going to give her\n$400 a week. And the guy says to the"}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 859000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 855940, "text": "judge, well, that's mighty nice of you.\nMaybe I'll try to kick in a couple of"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 860000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 859000, "text": "bucks myself."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 862400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861400, "text": "Yeah,"}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 865000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 864000, "text": "I get that a lot."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 869240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 867320, "text": "Hello. I'm Dr. Engelman."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 873280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 869740, "text": "Oh, do we have a little tummy ache here?"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 879800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878600, "text": "Plexus are real good."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 884800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 881220, "text": "Doc, this is nothing really serious,\nright? I mean, this kind of stuff you"}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 885800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 884800, "text": "every day, right?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 886880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 885880, "text": "Not really."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 888520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887360, "text": "I'm a podiatrist."}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 891820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 890480, "text": "You're a foot doctor?"}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 894720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 892500, "text": "So? What are you implying?"}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 896180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894980, "text": "Nothing. Nothing."}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 900400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 896720, "text": "You think I'm not aware of the snide\nremarks you people make about us?"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 905540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 901320, "text": "You think I don't hear the raucous\nbunion humor at parties made at my"}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 907340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 906140, "text": "Well, let me tell you something."}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 912260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 908140, "text": "How dietary happens to be one of the\nmost vital, important of all the medical"}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 914840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 912260, "text": "disciplines. We are doctors, people."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 917500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915400, "text": "And don't you ever forget that."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 919680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 918300, "text": "So what do you think it is, Doc?"}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 921700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920240, "text": "It could be his shoes."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 924360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 923360, "text": "Say what?"}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 929100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924440, "text": "Oh, yes. People are often amazed at how\nmany problems are attributable to ill"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 930079, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 929100, "text": "-fitting footwear."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 932220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 930080, "text": "Trust me, Doc, it ain't my damn feet."}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 938090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 937070, "text": "this woman is pregnant."}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 942230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 939470, "text": "Oh, don't tell me you've never delivered\na baby before."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 946730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 942870, "text": "Well, just exactly how many people who\naren't obstetricians have."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 953230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 948830, "text": "What are you, some kind of a cult?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 961470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 957750, "text": "In about two minutes, I'm going to be\ncompletely naked."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 965050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963730, "text": "That's the two -minute warning."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 972680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 969840, "text": "about time we got her into a delivery\nroom? Lady, back off."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 974120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 973120, "text": "I'm the doctor."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 976680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974620, "text": "I'm under a lot of pressure here. I need\ntime to think."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 979100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 978100, "text": "Now, what would Dr."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 980260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979260, "text": "Show do?"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 983420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982420, "text": "Oh!"}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 986180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984800, "text": "Here comes Mr. Stark."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 988000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 986760, "text": "Oh, my God."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 990560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 988480, "text": "It's happening. My baby's coming."}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 992660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 990820, "text": "I didn't even get a chance to scrub up."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 995720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994100, "text": "I got some wet wipes in my wallet."}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 1005200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1004200, "text": "little late for that."}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 1006360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1005360, "text": "Please, no."}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 1007500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1006500, "text": "Do it now."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 1010940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1008240, "text": "But, Quanli, the book with the oath of\nallegiance is back in the courtroom."}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 1012180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1011180, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 1015560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1013200, "text": "Harry, what's the difference? Make\nsomething up."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 1016860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015860, "text": "Couldn't do that."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 1018260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1017260, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 1021700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020500, "text": "Oh, yes, you could."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 1025180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1023120, "text": "I'm seeing the head here."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 1028200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1025560, "text": "Harry! Oh, it certainly is."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 1030920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029700, "text": "Sorry, the oath."}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 1033180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1032020, "text": "Quanli, do you promise..."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 1037109, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1033390, "text": "to uphold and defend the Constitution of\nthe United States and obey all the laws"}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1038109, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1037109, "text": "and traffic signals?"}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1041150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1039589, "text": "Okay, skip the traffic signals."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1045990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042470, "text": "Mr. Robinson, your lab report just came\nback. It's definitely appendicitis. I"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1047210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045990, "text": "have to get you up to pre -op right\naway."}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1052010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1048810, "text": "Get away from my buck. No way I'm\nleaving with my baby. It's about to be"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1054490, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052650, "text": "Here come the shoulders."}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1060530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055730, "text": "Quantley, do you solemnly swear to ask\nnot what your country can do for you,"}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1061610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1060530, "text": "what you can do for your country?"}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1068680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1067500, "text": "We're almost there."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1070120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1069120, "text": "No!"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1076260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1072780, "text": "As a duly appointed representative of\nthe United States government, I hereby"}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1078080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076260, "text": "declare you an official U .S. citizen."}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1079700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1078700, "text": "Yeah,"}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1082900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1081900, "text": "it goes for you, too."}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1086720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1084840, "text": "Mac, you're a daddy."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1088580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087560, "text": "I'm a daddy."}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1091560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1090560, "text": "What is it?"}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1092860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091860, "text": "It's ugly."}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1101330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100330, "text": "It's a girl, Mac."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1103150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1102150, "text": "It's a girl."}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1106290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1104710, "text": "Get away from my daughter, Dan."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1109810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108810, "text": "Hey, Mac."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1112090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1110610, "text": "She's not really ugly."}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1115850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1112830, "text": "I just never saw one right out of the\npackage like that before."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1117990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1116690, "text": "I'm wrinkled up."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1123270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1119410, "text": "Actually, she's... beautiful."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1127070, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1125510, "text": "Oh, I'll say."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1129090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1127670, "text": "Look at those feet."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1142100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1140840, "text": "And there's your daddy."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1144900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142920, "text": "Yeah, and Papa's got a brand new bag."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1149980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1148780, "text": "Don't run off now."}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1154360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152640, "text": "Let me see my baby."}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1161140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1160140, "text": "Don't worry."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1163220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1161220, "text": "He doesn't always look like that."}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1166760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1165120, "text": "Isn't she beautiful?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1171620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1169100, "text": "You know, I can see a little of me in\nthat face."}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1174740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1172120, "text": "Yes. You're both drooling."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1179380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1178380, "text": "Kwan Lee."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1180760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1179760, "text": "Yes, Mac?"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1186220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1181240, "text": "In case I haven't mentioned it in the\nlast few minutes, I love you."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1188880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1187300, "text": "And I love you, Mac."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1192440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189720, "text": "And I love little what's -her -name,\ntoo."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1195660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194320, "text": "And that's another thing."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1199960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1196100, "text": "What are we going to name our daughter?\nWe can't call her... Hey, you for the"}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1200960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1199960, "text": "rest of her life."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1207420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1201700, "text": "Well, when I was growing up, there was a\ncharacter in a book who was very"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1208460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1207420, "text": "special to me."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1214140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209200, "text": "So I often thought if I ever had a\ndaughter, I'd name it after her."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1216940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1214540, "text": "Oh, that sounds nice."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1219440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218120, "text": "What was her name?"}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1221720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1220720, "text": "Flecka."}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1243120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242120, "text": "the birth announcement?"}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1244360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1243360, "text": "Renee Robinson."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1246040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1245000, "text": "That's a nice name."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1249780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246240, "text": "Yeah. I wonder what the middle initial F\nstands for."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1254200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1251500, "text": "Uh, sir, I think you better get in here."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1255440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254440, "text": "What's going on?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1259600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257600, "text": "Look, everyone, it's Yodja Stone."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1267340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1260460, "text": "What are all you people doing here? Oh,\nyour judgeship. If you"}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1271640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1267340, "text": "recall, the last thing you said to us\nbefore leaving for the hospital was..."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1272680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1271680, "text": "Wait here?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1278540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1274680, "text": "So you've been waiting here since\nFriday?"}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1279820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1278820, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1282680, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281680, "text": "Well,"}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1284340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283340, "text": "gee, I'm sorry."}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1288100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1284520, "text": "I don't think you really quite\nunderstood. See, when I didn't come"}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1289100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1288100, "text": "should have just gone home."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1291040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1289420, "text": "I'm safe for firing squad."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1295700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1293020, "text": "Nobody wanted to take the chance of\nblowing his citizenship."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1298340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1297000, "text": "It's easy for you to say."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1307520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303280, "text": "to jip you out of a ceremony, but I\nthink, uh, I think what you've subjected"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1311620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1307520, "text": "yourselves to here says more about your\ndevotion to this country than words ever"}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1313600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1311620, "text": "could. So, congratulations."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1318020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1314380, "text": "You are all hereby citizens of the\nUnited States of America."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1319420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1318420, "text": "Yay!"}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1321780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1320660, "text": "It is true."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1326860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1322020, "text": "I have finally realized the dream of my\nlife. I am now a... Yes, you're a"}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1327860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1326860, "text": "taxpayer."}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1330180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1328920, "text": "Oh, bless you."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1332460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1331460, "text": "Judge,"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1338150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1332810, "text": "I know you're very busy, and you have\nmany important cases to decide, but this"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1339930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1338150, "text": "is a momentous occasion for us."}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1344530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340230, "text": "Would it be too much to ask if we could\nsing our national anthem?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1347870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345230, "text": "No, that wouldn't be too much at all.\nYou go right ahead."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1349210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1348210, "text": "Oh, thank you."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1351910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1350530, "text": "All right, everybody."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1355350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1353770, "text": "Oh, say..."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1366410, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1364490, "text": "Times like this make me feel really\nfortunate."}
